    {
      "id": "pandas-34473",
      "scenario": "bugfix",
      "language": "C/Python",
      "pr_url": "https://github.com/pandas-dev/pandas/pull/34473",
      "title": "fix to_json for numbers larger than sys.maxsize",
      "status": "completed",
      "duration_ms": 0,
      "references": [
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/lib/ultrajsonenc.c",
          "line": 1119,
          "body": "This goes back to L1636. CPython manages a global error and we never explicitly clear it on that line. You could call `PyErr_Clear()` but it actually would be better if you used `PyLong_AsLongLongAndOverflow` and checked for a non-zero overflow.",
          "cid": 441965192,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "correctness",
          "kind": "defect"
        },
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 2136,
          "body": "Make sure you Py_DECREF these objects when they are no longer needed or else this will leak memory.",
          "cid": 436401921,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "correctness",
          "kind": "defect"
        },
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 2135,
          "body": "If this object gets released would also free bytes, so need to memcpy first. Also just use Py_DECREF for these as simple enough to see lifecycle.",
          "cid": 437870883,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "correctness",
          "kind": "defect"
        },
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 2133,
          "body": "You will want PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize here. You can pass outLen as the second argument.",
          "cid": 436401611,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "correctness",
          "kind": "suggestion"
        },
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 1639,
          "body": "Bytes is assigned to cStr but you won't free it in this branch. We need an extra branch that checks for the JT_BIGNUM type and frees cStr in that case.",
          "cid": 442585616,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "correctness",
          "kind": "defect"
        },
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 1632,
          "body": "No need to prepend an underscore here; may be confusing to authors who expect that to mean something. (`int overflow = 0;`)",
          "cid": 442356287,
          "author": "WillAyd",
          "dimension": "readability",
          "kind": "suggestion"
        }
      ],
      "findings": [
        {
          "file": "pandas/_libs/src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c",
          "line": 2135,
          "severity": "medium",
          "confidence": "high",
          "body": "新增的 Object_getBigNumStringValue 未检查 PyObject_Str 与 PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize 的返回值是否为空，也未在失败时回填 *_outLen。若 PyObject_Str 失败，repr 为 NULL；PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize 对非 Unicode 入参只置错并返回 NULL，不写长度，于是按未初始化的 szlen 计算长度并 memcpy，可能崩溃或分配异常大小。",
          "evidence": "PyObject* repr = PyObject_Str(obj);\n    const char *str = PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize(repr, (Py_ssize_t *) _outLen);\n    char* bytes = PyObject_Malloc(*_outLen + 1);\n    memcpy(bytes, str, *_outLen + 1);",
          "trigger": "对位数极多的整数调用 to_json/ujson.encode：Python 3.11+ 默认 int_max_str_digits=4300，str(10**5000) 会抛 ValueError；或内存不足使 PyObject_Str 返回 NULL。需确认目标 Python 版本是否启用了该上限。",
          "impact": "PyObject_Str 失败时进入未定义行为：memcpy 以 NULL 源或未初始化长度执行，可能导致解释器段错误；错误信息也被覆盖丢失。",
          "suggestion": "校验 repr 与 str 是否为 NULL，失败时返回 NULL 或经 SetError 设置 encoder 错误；仅在成功时写入 *_outLen，并检查 PyObject_Malloc 结果；可加断言或错误分支测试（含 10**5000 这类超长整数）。",
          "verification_status": "second_pass_review_passed",
          "verification_reason": "新增函数 Object_getBigNumStringValue 无条件信任 PyObject_Str/PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize 的成功返回：src/ujson/python/objToJSON.c:2135-2138 直接对可能为 NULL 的 repr/str 调用后续 API 并 memcpy，且 *_outLen 仅在 PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize 成功时才会被写入。触发路径已查明：object 为溢出的 PyLong 时 Object_beginTypeContext 设 tc-\u003etype=JT_BIGNUM（行 1637-1639），ultrajsonenc.c:1111-1114 的 JT_BIGNUM 分支调用该函数指针并把局部未初始化 szlen 传址，随后用 value/szlen 生成输出。在 Python 3.11+ 默认 int_max_str_digits=4300 下，str(10**5000) 抛 ValueError，PyObject_Str 返回 NULL 且置错；此时 PyUnicode_AsUTF8AndSize(NULL,...) 会对 NULL 解引用（其入口 PyUnicode_Check(NULL) 即 Py_TYPE(NULL)-\u003eob_type），或若该实现选择优雅返回 NULL，则 szlen 保持未初始化，随后按未初始化长度 PyObject_Malloc/memcpy 产生越界读或异常分配。两种分支均为内存不安全，且函数未调用 SetError，编码器在 enc-\u003eerrorMsg 为空的情况下会继续使用 NULL value 与未初始化 szlen。",
          "trace_id": "19e99b866e976c97"
        },
