          "dimension": "performance",
          "kind": "suggestion"
        },
        {
          "file": "tokio-util/src/sync/cancellation_token/tree_node.rs",
          "line": 343,
          "body": "Here, we _could_ avoid adopting the grandchildren that have no children. It would be more efficient.",
          "cid": 867332429,
          "author": "Darksonn",
          "dimension": "performance",
          "kind": "suggestion"
        },
        {
          "file": "tokio-util/src/sync/cancellation_token/tree_node.rs",
          "line": 1,
          "body": "it would be nice if there was some top-level documentation explaining how this structure *works*, as well as the invariants that it upholds. the implementation has a bunch of inline comments, but there isn't a summary of the general design anywhere that i can find...",
